{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "feels concerned", "depth": 0, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.1600560475848287, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feels like I should be helping more.", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just thinking about Bro's studies. He's doing great, but I see him struggle sometimes. Feels like I should be helping more.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just trying to balance his workload and his well-being. Not sure if I'm doing enough.", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things have been okay. Just trying to balance his workload and his well-being. Not sure if I'm doing enough.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 108}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T203539Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T204542Z", "first_seen_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 2}
{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "To support a loved one", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feels like I should be helping more.", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "He's doing great, but I see him struggle sometimes. Feels like I should be helping more.", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just thinking about Bro's studies. He's doing great, but I see him struggle sometimes. Feels like I should be helping more.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "I just want him to know I'm here for him, no matter what.", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 122}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just trying to balance his workload and his well-being. Not sure if I'm doing enough.", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "I appreciate that. But I also feel like I need to do more, like I should be proactive instead of just reactive. Sometimes it’s hard to strike the right balance.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 160}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "My brother seems more independent now, which is both reassuring and a bit scary.", "char_start": 23, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "I think it’s important to give him space to grow, but also check in regularly to make sure he’s okay.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 101}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "He hasn’t asked for help lately, and I’m not sure if that’s a good thing.", "char_start": 105, "char_end": 178}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T203539Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T204831Z", "first_seen_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "To feel competent", "depth": 3, "parent_id": "nd002", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.12448803701042231, "confidence_raw": 0.7, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feels like I should be helping more.", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "I guess not too much. He’s smart, though. I just check in occasionally, but maybe I should do more.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 99}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It feels like I should be doing more, but he seems fine on his own. I just want him to succeed and feel supported.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 114}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But I still worry. I guess I just want to be sure I'm doing enough.", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "I just want him to know I'm here for him, no matter what.", "char_start": 65, "char_end": 122}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I try to give him space, but I worry he's falling behind without my help. He never asks though.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not sure if I'm doing enough.", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Still worry about if I'm missing something.", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 128}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I feel like I could be doing more. Like when he didn’t ask for help with that assignment, I wondered if I should have noticed.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 169}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T203539Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T204542Z", "first_seen_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": true, "sessions_seen": 2}
{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "To be needed", "depth": 3, "parent_id": "nd002", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.10670403172321913, "confidence_raw": 0.6, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Feels like I should be helping more.", "char_start": 101, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But I still worry. I guess I just want to be sure I'm doing enough.", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not sure if I'm doing enough.", "char_start": 79, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Still worry about if I'm missing something.", "char_start": 85, "char_end": 128}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Sometimes it’s hard to strike the right balance.", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 160}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "It's nice to know my presence helps, but I still feel like I could be doing more. Sometimes I worry too much about what he might need.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 134}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "I just wish I could give him some extra guidance without overwhelming him.", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 128}, {"session_id": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Maybe I can keep a note of them to remind myself. Thanks for the advice.", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 117}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261016T203539Z", "last_updated_at": "20261016T204542Z", "first_seen_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000401-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": true, "sessions_seen": 2}
